			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T18:49:22.589Z",
			"content": "<p>Well I for one have been working internally on mitigations and missed lunch dealing with this. The last thing on my mind was an announcement via socials. This is a good reminder to post, and I will go do that now, but also lets not judge OSS maintainers while we are at it.</p>",
