		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:f5vv2f7a4huhkcqy6b4fp5ge/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydwq2a2ic2q",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydwlp5gks2h",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/notwes.bsky.social/post/3lydwq2a2ic2q",
			"author": {
				"name": "Wes",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/notwes.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:f5vv2f7a4huhkcqy6b4fp5ge/bafkreiebj773g2oa6omrxl5awgjk2yuegy4c6dwy3725lig5aok7rkib7y"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T19:27:01.997Z",
			"content": "<p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/notwes.bsky.social/post/3lydumpief22m\">bsky.app/profile/notw...</a></p>\n<p>As much as I am pro responsibility for OSS maintainers, I want to point out that there are more important things you can do than make a social post. Let's level up our empathy and start with giving that grace to fellow maintainers.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydxpxsuwk2d",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydwlp5gks2h",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lydxpxsuwk2d",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T19:44:53.210Z",
			"content": "<p>oh, huh — are you the only one doing release management over there? sorry for roping you in after-hours</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:evph6ayag33r37opfma7ctz3/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydylhf6l22u",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dummdidumm.bsky.social/post/3lydylhf6l22u",
			"author": {
				"name": "Simon H",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dummdidumm.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:evph6ayag33r37opfma7ctz3/bafkreihbrvlmx6x4oje7rc7v3u4ekdcr72va3732tl6swkkwqpipatseq4"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T20:00:15.509Z",
			"content": "<p>What a weird thing to say while people are actively analyzing the impact of the situation, some after-hours</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydyrd6kes2h",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydxpxsuwk2d",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3lydyrd6kes2h",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T20:03:32.423Z",
			"content": "<p>I was genuinely grateful for the heads-up, and that's why I took the lead in doing the mitigation. Luckily others were around to handle the release while I took my daughter to gymnastics. We did the socials after the release. Not everything needs to be an opportunity to dunk on other maintainers</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydyydtfds2k",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydyrd6kes2h",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lydyydtfds2k",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T20:07:27.987Z",
			"content": "<p>Huh… sorry. I don’t want the post to come across as a dunk — I was only reacting to the situation in real time and was surprised the ecosystem at large wasn’t escalating faster</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydz2ss3tk2k",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lydyydtfds2k",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3lydz2ss3tk2k",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-09-08T20:08:50.783Z",
			"content": "<p>OK, cool. Most of the relevant core maintainers are in Europe, so it was out of hours for us all. We don't have pagerduty: we just have Discord!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
